{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Fighter is a tense round-based action game with rogue-lite elements, inspired by classic survival modes. </strong>You play as a young boy left home alone for the night, facing off against waves of strange nighttime creatures. Each wave gets tougher, each minute more intense. A unique mix of tension, stylized action, and childhood bravery creates a fast-paced fight for survival \u2014 can you make it until sunrise?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730090?t=1768857768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730090?t=1768857768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730090/b1b5734d1c7eea31d05f6b141374b7278c4782fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768857768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730090/b1b5734d1c7eea31d05f6b141374b7278c4782fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768857768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Fighter is a tense round-based action game with rogue-lite elements, inspired by classic survival modes. </strong>You play as a young boy left home alone for the night, facing off against waves of strange nighttime creatures. Each wave gets tougher, each minute more intense. A unique mix of tension, stylized action, and childhood bravery creates a fast-paced fight for survival \u2014 can you make it until sunrise?</p>","developers":[" Ond\u0159ej Hlad\u00edk"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730090/c682aa4b5f3394fe8ab5ce7eb740824766f75564/header.jpg?t=1768857768","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"m